    <item>
      <title>绝了！Claude Fable 5二次越狱，黑客20小时撬开神话防线，最后却说：不如Google一下？</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/claude-fable-520google-20260703161013471-1/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 03 Jul 2026 16:10:13 +0800</pubDate>
